{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@discardableResult"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"componentSpan","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Result","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reading","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"type","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Span","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Result"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"text":"Result","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"type","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component type."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"body","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Receives the span; its result is returned."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The span covers every component of the type in storage order, which is not the creation order once components were"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"removed. It is zero copy: it views the storage itself. Because "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Span"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"~Escapable"},{"type":"text","text":", it cannot leave "},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(storing it in a variable outside the closure or returning it is a compile time error), so it can never dangle.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var maxX = 0","nexus.componentSpan(reading: Position.self) { (positions: Span<Position>) in","    for i in positions.indices { maxX = max(maxX, positions[i].x) }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Span"},{"type":"text","text":" is not a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence"},{"text":": loop over ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"indices"},{"type":"text","text":". Element access is bounds checked."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"type":"text","text":" runs the type is locked for reading: structural changes (creating or destroying entities, adding or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"removing components, replacing a component with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"set"},{"type":"text","text":") and writes to the type stop the process with a message,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"since they would move or change what the span views. Reading the component through the nexus and reading"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the type again are fine. Collect changes and apply them after the call."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An empty storage (or a type no entity ever had) passes an empty span."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Storage","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Storage"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The sparse-set storage keeps all components of a type in one array, so the span always views the storage itself.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The archetype storage keeps one column per table (one table per component set), so entities with different","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component sets are not next to each other. If one table holds all components of the type the span views its column,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as above. If several tables hold them, the span views a temporary copy that is made table by table, which costs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one allocation and O(N) copying per call and is released after ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEachComponentSpan(reading:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to get zero copy spans, one batch per table.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(1) plus "},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus"]]},"metadata":{"title":"componentSpan(reading:_:)","extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS5NexusC13componentSpan7reading_q_xm_q_s0E0VyxGKXEtKAA9ComponentRzr0_lF","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"